WEBVTT

00:00:02.630 --> 00:00:05.660
Please! Take me with you to
the Black Pampas Grass!

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:10.270
I'm going to seal
Karasumori one day

00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:13.040
so no one has
to fight anymore.

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:18.570
I don't want anyone to
get hurt there ever again.

00:00:19.050 --> 00:00:21.570
At the very least,
I want to avenge Shishio!

00:00:22.020 --> 00:00:24.080
Please! Take me with you!

00:00:25.790 --> 00:00:28.620
No. Not in the state
you are in now.

00:00:30.830 --> 00:00:33.030
If your powers control you instead,

00:00:33.030 --> 00:00:34.520
you cannot be called
a full-fledged Caster.

00:00:35.330 --> 00:00:36.320
Damn it!

00:00:38.370 --> 00:00:43.640
The dangerous forest invites me
It's showtime again tonight

00:00:43.640 --> 00:00:45.510
(Ayakashi NIGHT)

00:00:45.510 --> 00:00:50.710
Everyone's rampaging
with all their strength

00:00:50.710 --> 00:00:52.610
(Fighting late into the night)

00:00:53.110 --> 00:00:56.050
Drive away all hesitation

00:00:56.050 --> 00:01:00.450
Wanna take them on? Yeah

00:01:00.620 --> 00:01:03.990
I will protect you
(No matter what)

00:01:03.990 --> 00:01:07.330
I will protect you, that's all
(that's all I want)

00:01:07.330 --> 00:01:12.990
Goodbye to the days
when all I'd do was cry

00:01:15.300 --> 00:01:17.500
Sha la la la la...

00:01:18.840 --> 00:01:23.910
I hold words in my heart
that I'd like to say

00:01:23.910 --> 00:01:25.880
(Secret romance)

00:01:25.880 --> 00:01:31.090
Standing in front of me is someone
I don't want to lose

00:01:31.090 --> 00:01:32.850
(A strange distance)

00:01:33.320 --> 00:01:39.690
I can't stand watching
people get hurt anymore

00:01:39.760 --> 00:01:40.760
Yeah

00:01:40.760 --> 00:01:44.230
I wanna be your knight
(I wanna be strong)

00:01:44.230 --> 00:01:47.840
I wanna be your light
(More than I am now)

00:01:47.840 --> 00:01:53.170
Someday I'll share with you
my 100% smile

00:02:11.890 --> 00:02:14.260
Yoshi! Yoshi!

00:02:15.630 --> 00:02:16.620
There you are.

00:02:16.660 --> 00:02:19.000
They told me to tell you to
hurry up and eat breakfast.

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:20.870
Huh? Okay...

00:02:21.900 --> 00:02:23.340
What are you doing?

00:02:26.040 --> 00:02:27.030
These are...

00:02:27.980 --> 00:02:31.100
I'm taking a break from
baking for the time being.

00:02:31.810 --> 00:02:33.780
I have other stuff
I need to do right now.

00:02:34.350 --> 00:02:35.480
Yoshi...

00:02:35.580 --> 00:02:39.310
He's never stopped baking,
no matter how hard things got...

00:02:41.460 --> 00:02:42.450
SEALED

00:02:42.620 --> 00:02:43.650
There!

00:02:45.230 --> 00:02:45.890
What's wrong?

00:02:46.790 --> 00:02:50.230
I'm sorry.
I wish I could fight, too.

00:02:50.570 --> 00:02:55.970
Don't worry about it.
I'll train and beat them all up!

00:02:56.270 --> 00:02:58.070
Train? What are you going to do?

00:02:59.770 --> 00:03:01.210
I don't know.

00:03:01.580 --> 00:03:02.940
Oh.

00:03:03.340 --> 00:03:06.510
Then why don't you ask Grandpa?

00:03:07.850 --> 00:03:10.110
He was so awesome that night.

00:03:10.790 --> 00:03:13.650
A bunch of weird guys
came here.

00:03:14.290 --> 00:03:17.120
But Grandpa destroyed
all of them really fast!

00:03:17.490 --> 00:03:19.330
Then he built a giant Kekkai

00:03:19.330 --> 00:03:21.350
that surrounded our house
and next door too.

00:03:22.100 --> 00:03:24.630
On top of that,
he left Shikigami at our place

00:03:24.630 --> 00:03:27.070
before heading over
to Karasumori.

00:03:28.640 --> 00:03:30.190
I see.

00:03:30.740 --> 00:03:33.300
His speed and power
are great for sure.

00:03:34.040 --> 00:03:36.810
I respect Grandpa
a lot more now!

00:03:37.850 --> 00:03:39.680
What is it?
Are you talking about me?

00:03:41.050 --> 00:03:43.110
What are you doing
instead of eating your breakfast?

00:03:43.350 --> 00:03:47.310
Yoshi wants to ask you
something about techniques!

00:03:48.260 --> 00:03:49.950
Oh? That's rare.

00:03:50.020 --> 00:03:51.990
So you finally realize that

00:03:51.990 --> 00:03:55.590
you have a great senior mentor
right in front of you?

00:03:55.800 --> 00:03:58.560
Well, I suppose it's good
that you realized it at all.

00:03:59.270 --> 00:04:04.530
What is it? Ask me anything.
Maybe I'll teach you.

00:04:06.040 --> 00:04:07.100
No thank you!

00:04:07.180 --> 00:04:08.160
What?!

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:16.510
Hey! How dare you treat
a senior mentor that way!

00:04:16.780 --> 00:04:18.120
Wait, Yoshimori!

00:04:18.850 --> 00:04:21.450
- Oh fine then! I see how it is!
- I'm never going to ask you.

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:25.490
I'll do it alone!

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:29.160
But what should I do?

00:04:32.100 --> 00:04:33.970
In order to defeat Kaguro...

00:04:34.640 --> 00:04:37.400
Shut up! Just get out of my way!

00:04:38.770 --> 00:04:42.640
Not this.
It's not interesting at all.

00:04:43.280 --> 00:04:45.040
In order to deal with his speed...

00:05:12.040 --> 00:05:14.530
This is not the time
to be sleeping!

00:05:16.980 --> 00:05:18.950
I don't get it!

00:05:28.660 --> 00:05:29.990
All right!

00:05:32.490 --> 00:05:34.890
Long time no see, Yoshi-boy.

00:05:37.570 --> 00:05:38.690
Y-Yeah!

00:05:38.970 --> 00:05:41.330
Look at how big you are now.

00:05:41.740 --> 00:05:45.140
You were only this big
when you used to visit.

00:05:45.370 --> 00:05:47.710
I... wasn't that small...

00:05:48.110 --> 00:05:50.130
So what are you doing?

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:55.180
I didn't know what to do,
so I went out and ran.

00:05:57.550 --> 00:05:58.850
Ahh, it sounds like youth.

00:05:59.020 --> 00:06:00.010
That's not it!

00:06:00.420 --> 00:06:01.720
Then what is it?

00:06:02.990 --> 00:06:04.220
Well...

00:06:04.630 --> 00:06:08.560
It's nothing like that.
It's... you know...

00:06:09.100 --> 00:06:10.360
I don't know what
I need to do...

00:06:10.400 --> 00:06:12.530
It felt like the only thing
I can do is run...

00:06:14.440 --> 00:06:16.340
That's youth all right.

00:06:16.640 --> 00:06:18.300
I already told you that's not it!

00:06:18.740 --> 00:06:22.470
Then just tell me what it is.
I'll hear you out.

00:06:23.340 --> 00:06:29.010
I don't think I can get the answer
from other people.

00:06:30.020 --> 00:06:31.680
I have to understand it myself.

00:06:33.250 --> 00:06:36.120
Then think as much
as you need to.

00:06:36.660 --> 00:06:37.650
No!

00:06:41.200 --> 00:06:42.250
I don't have time.

00:06:43.560 --> 00:06:45.430
You're so selfish.

00:06:45.830 --> 00:06:51.770
But what you're doing now
might not be wrong.

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:57.700
There are times when you can find
answers by working furiously...

00:06:58.210 --> 00:07:00.340
But that works only when
you're still young.

00:07:02.250 --> 00:07:04.780
Shigemori used to be like that.

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:06.080
Grandpa Shige too?

00:07:09.660 --> 00:07:11.220
Sir! Can I use the hill out back?

00:07:11.690 --> 00:07:14.320
Go ahead.
But what are you going to do?

00:07:15.200 --> 00:07:16.360
I'm going to run around!

00:07:24.170 --> 00:07:27.110
I'm gonna work more furiously
than Grandpa Shige!

00:07:27.610 --> 00:07:28.270
Ketsu!

00:07:30.950 --> 00:07:32.000
All right!

00:07:32.080 --> 00:07:32.740
Ketsu!

00:07:34.320 --> 00:07:37.810
Whoops. Damn it!
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:07:41.320 --> 00:07:42.310
Wait!

00:07:43.590 --> 00:07:48.030
Damn it! I can't catch them!
Fine then!

00:07:50.130 --> 00:07:53.070
Ouch! What are you doing?!

00:07:56.000 --> 00:08:00.140
S-Stop! Ow! Wait! Not there!

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:00.800
Ketsu!

00:08:08.450 --> 00:08:10.010
Dammit!

00:08:10.550 --> 00:08:13.250
I'm not going to lose to them.

00:08:14.120 --> 00:08:18.320
All right! I'm going to use
you guys for my training!

00:08:22.330 --> 00:08:24.300
I'll catch all of you!

00:08:29.640 --> 00:08:31.700
I surrounded all of you!

00:08:36.410 --> 00:08:37.950
I guess it doesn't mean anything

00:08:37.950 --> 00:08:40.380
unless I catch each of
them one by one.

00:08:42.650 --> 00:08:43.310
Kai.

00:08:46.620 --> 00:08:48.380
I'll definitely become stronger!

00:08:54.730 --> 00:08:56.460
I'm home.

00:09:00.430 --> 00:09:02.060
What's wrong, Yoshi?

00:09:17.150 --> 00:09:18.910
It's already this late...

00:09:23.860 --> 00:09:24.850
All right!

00:09:31.570 --> 00:09:32.660
All right!

00:09:38.510 --> 00:09:39.500
Ketsu!

00:09:46.350 --> 00:09:47.410
Come on!

00:09:55.590 --> 00:09:58.420
He's starting so early today.

00:10:01.260 --> 00:10:02.900
One more time!

00:10:02.900 --> 00:10:04.160
Yoshimori!

00:10:04.700 --> 00:10:07.170
Cut it out!

00:10:07.170 --> 00:10:08.970
- Can't you be more quiet?!
- Grandpa Shige! Look up! Up!

00:10:14.410 --> 00:10:15.940
Watch it!

00:10:15.940 --> 00:10:18.280
Shut up! It's your fault!

00:10:18.310 --> 00:10:19.350
What?!

00:10:19.350 --> 00:10:21.140
Don't talk to me while
I'm training!

00:10:21.350 --> 00:10:23.990
Training, my butt!
You're still so inexperienced.

00:10:23.990 --> 00:10:25.110
What?!

00:10:26.250 --> 00:10:28.240
I guess he's trying hard
in his own way.

00:10:29.290 --> 00:10:31.260
I should, too!

00:10:38.570 --> 00:10:40.630
All right. Let's start class.

00:10:41.940 --> 00:10:43.340
Is Sumimura absent?

00:10:50.380 --> 00:10:52.850
H-Hey, Sumimura...

00:10:54.620 --> 00:10:56.380
Good morning.

00:10:58.920 --> 00:11:01.820
Sumimura, the greeting
more suited to your situation

00:11:01.860 --> 00:11:03.320
would be "good night."

00:11:04.190 --> 00:11:06.460
That's another record!

00:11:06.690 --> 00:11:07.600
Of what?

00:11:07.600 --> 00:11:08.800
The amount of time
he takes to fall asleep

00:11:08.800 --> 00:11:09.790
after getting to class!

00:11:11.730 --> 00:11:15.190
He must be really tired
from his work.

00:11:22.940 --> 00:11:24.470
Tokine looks sleepy.

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:26.310
There's something wrong
with her lately.

00:11:27.350 --> 00:11:28.510
Oh, my.

00:11:30.720 --> 00:11:33.050
Who can answer this question?

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:34.310
Sensei!

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:36.750
I think Yukimura-san would know!

00:11:38.090 --> 00:11:40.460
Then Yukimura-san,
if you please.

00:11:40.460 --> 00:11:41.120
S-Sure.

00:11:45.070 --> 00:11:47.360
Silly. I hope you make
a fool of yourself.

00:11:48.170 --> 00:11:50.030
Mao is so mean.

00:11:55.280 --> 00:11:56.830
Correct.

00:11:58.310 --> 00:12:00.410
Wow! That's Tokine for you!

00:12:00.920 --> 00:12:02.310
I can't stand her!

00:12:05.620 --> 00:12:09.390
Now, who should read
the next part?

00:12:09.760 --> 00:12:11.730
Hey, Sumimura.
He's going to call on you.

00:12:12.060 --> 00:12:14.690
No, I don't like to expend
energy unnecessarily.

00:12:14.960 --> 00:12:17.590
He isn't going to wake up today.

00:12:27.540 --> 00:12:31.000
Is the school bell like
an alarm clock to him?

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:34.810
You really shouldn't
overwork yourself.

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:37.610
Everything will go to waste
if you get sick.

00:12:37.920 --> 00:12:38.580
Yeah.

00:12:39.490 --> 00:12:41.290
You were doing something
this morning

00:12:41.290 --> 00:12:43.760
and yesterday that completely
exhausted you, right?

00:12:44.190 --> 00:12:45.660
Oh. Training.

00:12:45.860 --> 00:12:46.860
Training?

00:12:46.860 --> 00:12:50.520
They're actually really quick
and hard to deal with.

00:12:50.900 --> 00:12:51.560
Huh?

00:12:51.830 --> 00:12:53.270
They're black,

00:12:53.270 --> 00:12:55.430
and their movements make them
seem even more malicious.

00:12:55.640 --> 00:12:56.300
What?

00:12:56.370 --> 00:12:58.740
And you never know
when they'll fly.

00:13:00.010 --> 00:13:01.630
They're black...

00:13:02.910 --> 00:13:04.610
And their movements make them
seem even more malicious.

00:13:05.650 --> 00:13:07.480
And you never know
when they'll fly?

00:13:09.380 --> 00:13:10.370
Could they be...

00:13:12.890 --> 00:13:16.650
Your training involves
fighting them?

00:13:16.820 --> 00:13:17.480
Yeah.

00:13:17.530 --> 00:13:18.690
I can't believe this.

00:13:18.690 --> 00:13:19.350
Huh?

00:13:19.690 --> 00:13:21.720
I didn't think you were that weird.

00:13:21.930 --> 00:13:23.200
Huh? Why?

00:13:23.200 --> 00:13:24.790
Hey! Don't come near me!

00:13:25.030 --> 00:13:26.730
Huh? Huh?

00:13:26.900 --> 00:13:28.670
But if you're
fighting them for real,

00:13:28.670 --> 00:13:31.370
I'll tell you the best strategy
against them!

00:13:31.710 --> 00:13:32.440
What? Really?

00:13:32.440 --> 00:13:33.700
Just don't come near me!

00:13:33.940 --> 00:13:36.310
Listen. First, it's about speed.

00:13:36.910 --> 00:13:41.080
You have to be quick!
You can't win without speed.

00:13:43.650 --> 00:13:46.020
If you hesitate for even a moment,
it will be fatal.

00:13:46.320 --> 00:13:46.980
Be careful!

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:48.990
I think you're exaggerating.

00:13:48.990 --> 00:13:50.390
Don't underestimate the enemy!

00:13:51.690 --> 00:13:54.750
Second, observe their
movements carefully.

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:57.890
You don't know when
they'll fly, right?

00:13:58.700 --> 00:14:00.430
That's why you have
to observe them.

00:14:01.870 --> 00:14:04.600
That way, you won't get
hit by them!

00:14:05.470 --> 00:14:06.460
You got that?!

00:14:07.170 --> 00:14:08.610
Yeah! I got it!

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:12.080
By the way,
why are you so far away?

00:14:12.250 --> 00:14:13.240
I am?

00:14:13.280 --> 00:14:16.310
So how do you know so much
about fighting them?

00:14:17.350 --> 00:14:18.680
Mom told me.

00:14:19.190 --> 00:14:20.590
What? Your mom?!

00:14:21.190 --> 00:14:24.210
Why does Tokine's mom
fight crows?

00:14:24.390 --> 00:14:25.380
Yoshimori!

00:14:25.690 --> 00:14:27.130
I've told you what I know,

00:14:27.130 --> 00:14:29.060
so you better get each and every
one of those little things.

00:14:29.230 --> 00:14:30.890
Huh? Little things?

00:14:31.000 --> 00:14:31.990
What?

00:14:32.300 --> 00:14:35.790
Crows don't count as little things...

00:14:36.070 --> 00:14:37.630
What? Crows?

00:14:38.110 --> 00:14:38.760
Yeah.

00:14:38.840 --> 00:14:41.070
What... were you talking about?

00:14:41.640 --> 00:14:43.630
What were you talking about?

00:14:44.180 --> 00:14:46.150
Oh, you were talking about cockro-

00:14:46.150 --> 00:14:47.940
Nooooo!

00:14:48.950 --> 00:14:51.540
Don't say their name!

00:15:00.090 --> 00:15:02.190
W-What's her problem?

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:20.170
It's happening again.

00:15:23.450 --> 00:15:24.440
Kaguro.

00:15:24.590 --> 00:15:27.350
Why the long face?

00:15:28.560 --> 00:15:31.420
To me, this scenery is beautiful.

00:15:32.530 --> 00:15:33.890
Come to think of it,

00:15:33.890 --> 00:15:37.730
you started to
utilize me a lot more

00:15:37.730 --> 00:15:40.630
since the castle's
started to crumble.

00:15:41.370 --> 00:15:42.770
Seems like it.

00:15:43.300 --> 00:15:46.970
When's the next one?
I can go at any time.

00:15:47.370 --> 00:15:49.240
It isn't your turn yet.

00:15:49.610 --> 00:15:54.140
If you go, you'll end up
killing the Kekkaishi.

00:15:55.120 --> 00:15:56.780
What do you mean by that?

00:15:57.920 --> 00:15:59.280
You'll find out soon.

00:16:20.040 --> 00:16:21.870
All right!

00:16:24.180 --> 00:16:27.880
Hey, Yoshi-boy. You seem to
be enjoying your youth again.

00:16:28.220 --> 00:16:32.550
It's not that,
but I think I can do it today.

00:16:35.760 --> 00:16:36.890
When you think about it,

00:16:36.890 --> 00:16:39.290
fighting roaches and crows
have a lot in common!

00:16:39.730 --> 00:16:40.720
Ketsu!

00:16:40.890 --> 00:16:41.880
Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:44.400
First, you have to be quick.

00:16:44.900 --> 00:16:46.890
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:16:48.470 --> 00:16:49.660
All right! I got them!

00:16:49.840 --> 00:16:51.110
And the second is...

00:16:51.110 --> 00:16:52.630
Observe their movements
carefully!

00:16:55.540 --> 00:16:56.570
Ketsu Ketsu!

00:16:59.950 --> 00:17:00.940
All right!

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:03.750
I need to keep this up
and try to raise my accuracy.

00:17:09.790 --> 00:17:12.350
Kaguro... I'll crush you!

00:17:12.730 --> 00:17:13.780
Ketsu!

00:17:15.630 --> 00:17:17.490
No matter how fast
you come at me...

00:17:19.930 --> 00:17:20.920
Ketsu Ketsu!

00:17:23.000 --> 00:17:24.160
No matter where
you attack me from...

00:17:32.610 --> 00:17:36.520
Damn it! Cheap surprise attacks...

00:17:36.520 --> 00:17:40.210
Ouch... there are
lots of crows around.

00:17:40.490 --> 00:17:43.010
I can't just use
the roach strategy.

00:17:49.730 --> 00:17:52.960
You guys aren't going
to get away with this!

00:18:14.860 --> 00:18:17.980
Why... Why can't I do it?

00:18:18.660 --> 00:18:20.520
Look at you all worn out.

00:18:20.790 --> 00:18:22.060
Oh, Sir...

00:18:22.430 --> 00:18:24.990
I see you're enjoying
your youth again.

00:18:25.170 --> 00:18:27.730
It's good to see young people
like this.

00:18:28.000 --> 00:18:29.030
It's not that.

00:18:29.140 --> 00:18:31.100
Then what?
You're just feeling mischievous?

00:18:31.270 --> 00:18:33.100
Not that either.

00:18:35.380 --> 00:18:37.640
What is it?
I'll listen if you want to talk.

00:18:37.980 --> 00:18:43.470
It may clear your head
if you talk about it with someone.

00:18:44.080 --> 00:18:47.180
Asking others is one way.
To not ask is another.

00:18:47.220 --> 00:18:48.350
Do as you wish.

00:18:49.490 --> 00:18:51.690
I envy you, always looking like
you have so much free time.

00:18:51.930 --> 00:18:54.020
All you do is sweep all day.

00:18:54.700 --> 00:18:57.930
You know, I may not look it
but I'm actually very busy.

00:18:58.070 --> 00:18:59.050
Liar!

00:18:59.130 --> 00:19:00.360
I'm not lying.

00:19:00.630 --> 00:19:02.660
I watch comedy on TV,

00:19:02.700 --> 00:19:04.730
and I have a date
with Ms. Tsune

00:19:04.770 --> 00:19:06.500
from the senior citizens
association.

00:19:06.610 --> 00:19:07.870
What is that?

00:19:08.240 --> 00:19:11.610
Damn, I'm really suffering here.

00:19:14.980 --> 00:19:19.480
Life is like sweeping fallen leaves
in the wind.

00:19:21.220 --> 00:19:26.160
Sweeping the leaves just in front
of you may be difficult,

00:19:26.160 --> 00:19:31.060
but if you sweep them downwind,
it actually becomes much easier.

00:19:31.300 --> 00:19:32.990
I don't get it.

00:19:34.070 --> 00:19:38.330
You can learn much
if you listen carefully.

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:42.600
Things aren't just what
they appear to be.

00:19:43.210 --> 00:19:45.770
It's important to feel as well.

00:19:46.210 --> 00:19:48.850
If you are too fixated on only
what you can see,

00:19:48.850 --> 00:19:51.120
you are bound to miss something.

00:19:51.120 --> 00:19:52.240
That must be avoided.

00:19:52.650 --> 00:19:57.180
Discard distracting thoughts
and accept things as they are.

00:19:58.130 --> 00:20:00.750
That is enlightenment.

00:20:03.960 --> 00:20:05.230
Thanks Sir!

00:20:11.070 --> 00:20:12.970
That's definitely youth...

00:20:15.580 --> 00:20:18.170
I might be able to do it.

00:20:29.090 --> 00:20:31.750
I think I understand it better.

00:20:33.960 --> 00:20:36.590
Yoshimori, where did
you get those wounds?

00:20:36.900 --> 00:20:38.560
Oh, this? It's nothing.

00:20:39.200 --> 00:20:42.070
Actually, you should worry
more about yourself.

00:20:43.340 --> 00:20:44.540
You looked like you were
about to fall asleep

00:20:44.540 --> 00:20:45.530
on your way to school.

00:20:45.940 --> 00:20:50.310
I can't help it. I don't know
when the Kokuboro will attack.

00:20:50.610 --> 00:20:52.410
I get anxious if I'm
not doing something.

00:20:54.110 --> 00:20:58.020
I don't want that to
ever happen again.

00:21:06.130 --> 00:21:06.790
Yeah...

00:21:09.030 --> 00:21:10.090
Yoshimori!

00:21:10.330 --> 00:21:10.990
Where are they?

00:21:11.530 --> 00:21:12.520
This way!

00:21:20.010 --> 00:21:21.600
Ketsu! Ketsu! Ketsu!

00:21:23.480 --> 00:21:24.470
They're fast!

00:21:24.710 --> 00:21:25.700
This sound...

00:21:26.810 --> 00:21:27.800
They're human...

00:21:28.450 --> 00:21:29.510
Are they from the Kokuboro?

00:21:31.490 --> 00:21:33.510
Hakubi, are there just three?

00:21:34.890 --> 00:21:37.290
Oh, no! There are lots more, honey.

00:21:39.190 --> 00:21:40.180
Here they come!

00:21:44.030 --> 00:21:46.430
We're surrounded!
How many of them are there?

00:21:46.870 --> 00:21:48.840
Yoshimori, we have to split up!

00:21:49.670 --> 00:21:50.660
Yoshimori!

00:21:51.470 --> 00:21:53.940
Don't be fixated on
only what you can see...

00:21:56.680 --> 00:21:59.370
Feel. Feel it!

00:22:02.050 --> 00:22:03.040
Accept it.

00:22:05.620 --> 00:22:07.680
Accept things as they are...

00:22:09.120 --> 00:22:09.780
Ketsu!

00:22:10.260 --> 00:22:12.230
Ketsu Ketsu Ketsu
Ketsu Ketsu Ketsu!

00:22:12.390 --> 00:22:14.830
Wow! He's faster
and more accurate!

00:22:14.830 --> 00:22:16.820
Ketsu Ketsu Ketsu
Ketsu Ketsu Ketsu!

00:22:17.130 --> 00:22:17.790
Ketsu!

00:22:46.060 --> 00:22:49.760
With a look on your face that says,
"I'm doing this for you"

00:22:49.800 --> 00:22:53.030
While being enthusiastic
across the table

00:22:53.170 --> 00:22:57.190
Why do you only tell me
dark predictions?

00:22:57.340 --> 00:23:00.800
It's a meaningless
use of language.

00:23:01.040 --> 00:23:04.600
Trying to avoid an emergency,
nothing's gonna happen

00:23:04.750 --> 00:23:08.580
I can't learn anything
(What's going on?)

00:23:08.620 --> 00:23:12.640
You're not bearing
the brunt of my future

00:23:12.690 --> 00:23:15.920
I am, it's common sense

00:23:15.960 --> 00:23:20.260
I can't go anywhere
if I'm always weak

00:23:20.290 --> 00:23:26.230
Train me so hard until I cry

00:23:27.870 --> 00:23:32.570
If you're gonna complain that
tough times are heading our way

00:23:32.610 --> 00:23:34.540
(if that's true)

00:23:34.570 --> 00:23:39.240
Please don't baby me
any more than you need to

00:23:39.380 --> 00:23:42.680
Please Please Please

00:23:42.720 --> 00:23:46.880
Even if I bleed
I'll get a hold of the wisdom

00:23:46.920 --> 00:23:50.220
To stand firm in
this unstable world

00:23:50.260 --> 00:23:54.490
You watch from far away

00:23:54.530 --> 00:24:00.490
It's strange that
I want to hold you

00:24:01.300 --> 00:24:02.600
Hey Hey
